Z||000034||Dave Gunsul||12-12-2001||12:35 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTFiero1:<BR><B>who is EDsB52?    what was his name and and he owns a B52 bomer?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Oh boy did you miss some fun reading if you<BR>don't know who Eds is.<BR>The JSocha Ed war was a real classic!<BR>Usually JSocha is a fun friendly guy but he<BR>can slam with the best of them, very funny reading. <BR>Then there's the Archie Eds wars these too are very funny reading.<BR>The guy even started screwing with Cliff<BR>which was completely brainless of him to do<BR>since Cliff runs the joint!<BR>If any of you that<BR>weren't here to read these epic battles in person and are going to look them up make sure you set aside a LOT of time and some<BR>aspirin because Ed is like the Energizer bunny: he gos on and on and on  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>Activities Director<BR>Northern IL. Fiero Enthusiasts<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
