Z||000042||Mach10||12-12-2001||12:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JSocha:<BR><B>Have to borrow this for a moment.<P>...<P>Just some food for thought or for the toilet.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's the HARD way of doing it... But it's a Mail-Bomb. Yeah, they'll shut down the email address to PROTECT their own server, and at the same time start a witch hunt to find whoever did it, and slap some federal offences charges... <P>Just let him fade into obscurity.<P>That is, unless someone has his personal info  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"><P>Then we just subscribe him to a couple of the more deviant magazines, and address it to HIS name, but his NEIGHBOR'S address. In a more innocent time, a Gay-Les publication was usually enough to completely discredit a person. Nowadays, you usually have to stoop to pedophilia or Zoophilia. But that don't bother me a bit, now DOES it?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||12
